(text "Electrode inputs, protection, mode switches SW1-SW5" (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5f431664-34ee-5ae8-8db9-49464d584e8e))
(text "SW1..SW5 = U201..U205 (ADG1219). IN=0 -> SA = PASSIVE path (solid in block diagram); IN=1 -> SB = EIS path (dotted)." (at 20 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c069e2e5-e3f7-5522-a6b0-4dd33f32f10c))
(text "Open throws (x in block diagram) are no-connect. EN (SW_EN) low = every electrode floating (safe power-up, contact isolation)." (at 20 30.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 332d8c3e-3268-5c59-b05c-c2a46965eca3))
(text "SW1 V+: SA->PASS_INP, SB->EIS_SENSE_P | SW2 REF: SA->PASS_INN | SW3 V-: SB->EIS_SENSE_N | SW4 I+: SB->EIS_IOUT | SW5 I-: SB->AGND (Howland return)" (at 20 33.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2ed4ae55-ccae-5009-9539-78681cff282e))
(text "Rs = 10k 0.1% limits fault current into BAV199 clamps (to +-5VA). Shields of all 5 coax cables = GUARD." (at 20 35.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f0c71c64-8c68-5112-83af-9fb8cda1a5eb))
(text "ADG1219 is only characterised at +-15 V / +12 V in its tables; +-5 V is inside its +-5..+-16.5 V range (see TODO.md)." (at 20 38.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3ac26411-e945-5960-a3b9-8bdf4e3f6acf))
